  "prefLabel": "Puc 1602.09 “Proposed tariff revisions” mean revisions or additions to the schedules of rates, charges, and terms and conditions within an existing tariff that a utility in",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.09 “Proposed tariff revisions” mean revisions or additions to the schedules of rates, charges, and terms and conditions within an existing tariff that a utility intends to become effective and that have not yet been approved by the commission. This term includes “proposed tariff page”.\n\nSource. #10535, eff 3-4-14; ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24",
